## Test Organization Patterns

### Co-located Tests (Recommended for React)

```
src/
├── components/
│   ├── Button/
│   │   ├── Button.tsx
│   │   ├── Button.test.tsx      # Unit tests
│   │   ├── Button.stories.tsx   # Storybook
│   │   └── index.ts
│   └── Form/
│       ├── Form.tsx
│       ├── Form.test.tsx
│       └── Form.integration.test.tsx  # Integration tests
├── hooks/
│   ├── useAuth.ts
│   └── useAuth.test.ts
└── utils/
    ├── formatters.ts
    └── formatters.test.ts
```

### Separate Test Directory

```
src/
├── components/
├── hooks/
└── utils/

__tests__/
├── unit/
│   ├── components/
│   ├── hooks/
│   └── utils/
├── integration/
│   └── flows/
└── fixtures/
    ├── users.json
    └── products.json

e2e/
├── specs/
│   ├── auth.spec.ts
│   └── checkout.spec.ts
├── fixtures/
│   └── auth.ts
└── pages/      # Page Object Models
    ├── LoginPage.ts
    └── CheckoutPage.ts
```

### Test File Naming Conventions

| Pattern | Use Case |
|---------|----------|
| `*.test.ts` | Unit tests |
| `*.spec.ts` | Integration/E2E tests |
| `*.integration.test.ts` | Explicit integration tests |
| `*.e2e.spec.ts` | Explicit E2E tests |
